old prisoner\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hf5QZTk7fBTo0DL92leLA4wkBlQ.jpg\"},{\"id\":1187113,\"name\":\"John Mark Ainsley\",\"character\":\"Skuratov\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2KAhaXG8ODy8mLZIn65M6RPXByo.jpg\"},{\"id\":1655746,\"name\":\"Jan Galla\",\"character\":\"Chekunov\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1655747,\"name\":\"Tomáš Krejčiřík\",\"character\":\"The drunken prisoner\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1655748,\"name\":\"Martin Bárta\",\"character\":\"The cook\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1655749,\"name\":\"Vratislav Kříž\",\"character\":\"The priest\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1655750,\"name\":\"Susannah Haberfeld\",\"character\":\"A prostitute\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1655751,\"name\":\"Marián Pavlovic\",\"character\":\"Kedril\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":342473,\"title\":\"Ballerina\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qBxMhcmNnFniuDAZTKEHcSgKtsn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wlLdcK3Sm7zp0w1ZuVvnFlmcchM.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1879 Paris, a young orphan dreams of becoming a ballerina and flees her rural Brittany for Paris, where she passes for someone else and accedes to the position of pupil at the Grand Opera house.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1038263,\"title\":\"Maria\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3oQRG0bwPUqE4N4n8z2kAzr7e40.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9iw4a6AQkxUO3EuRn59Vgrqf0zO.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Maria Callas, the world's greatest opera singer, lives the last days of her life in 1970s Paris, as she confronts her identity and life.\",\"genres\":[\"History\",\"Drama\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":76115,\"title\":\"The Phantom of the Opera at the Royal Albert Hall\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xYqpJl7XWENDfIy3CqtO8klHOTX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hjmKqTwOIwN52RBGM72bLSq9Gay.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A disfigured musical genius, hidden away in the Paris Opera House, terrorises the opera company for the unwitting benefit of a young protégée whom he trains and loves. The 25th anniversary of the first public performance of Phantom of the Opera was celebrated with a grand performance at the Royal Albert Hall in London.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":14353,\"title\":\"Repo! The Genetic Opera\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2G5LczM1clXu3byEudWk9w0KDYD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xLH9jvY4tNzcKvopgEGYI7YeAy7.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"By the year 2056, an epidemic of organ failures has devastated the planet. The megacorporation GeneCo provides organ transplants on a payment plan — and those unable to fulfill their plans have their organs repossessed. In the midst of this, a sickly teenager discovers a shocking secret about herself, her father, and their connection to GeneCo.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":352157,\"title\":\"Marguerite\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lfIleyisIzYfvUNXTLIfJjHiJz6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qJy1TAgMi0FmPVmrjedgfri63kc.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Paris in the 1920s. Marguerite Dumont is a wealthy woman with a passion for music and the opera. For years, she has performed regularly for a circle of guests. But Marguerite sings tragically out of tune and no one has ever told her. Her husband and her close friends have always encouraged her in her illusions. Things become very complicated the day she gets it into her head to perform in front of a genuine public, at the Opera.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":860890,\"title\":\"John Adams: Nixon in China\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2Z19r57mktVgtXqjau7ON9DQLQ3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mpDLXG3kLpn9yBWKY14VBDF8DOu.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Besides the landing on the moon by the Apollo 11 mission in 1969, Richard Nixon’s meeting with China’s leader Mao Zedong in February 1972 then represented one of the biggest media spectacles in history. Nixon himself established the reference between the two events: “We came in peace for all mankind” not only marked the lunar module Eagle’s landing spot – Nixon also spoke of it into the microphones just before his departure to China. It was not John Adam’s aim to create a superficial or even a caricaturing representation of Nixon’s visit when composing his opera. He attempted to create a “heroic opera” about the construction of modern myths by using archetypical characters and situations. Director Marco Štorman stages Adams’ minimal music opera as a deconstruction review about the power of images, the politics of staging and the staging of politics.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":305464,\"title\":\"The Metropolitan Opera: Il Trovatore\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lB6w0oW5yuGP2hLm9uBsJXz8AeR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cXUdqKxPjMMrTATF2Q1KcmUvHKy.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Verdi’s IL TROVATORE again storms the Met stage in a star-studded, anvil-wielding cast , including Sondra Radvanovsky, Dolora Zajick and Dmitri Hvorostovsky. Marcelo Álvarez sings Manrico, the troubadour of the title. The story is well-known already: The gypsy Azucena has harbored a grudge for thirty years, but she is about to have revenge at last. Meanwhile, her son Manrico is in love with Leonora, but so is his arch-enemy, the Count Di Luna. A pot-boiler, where every tune is a hit.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":290259,\"title\":\"Adriana Lecouvreur\",\"poster\":null,\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Francesco Cileo wrote this opera about the real life Adriana Lecouvreur, a French actress from the 18th Century who revolutionized acting by her naturalistic delivery.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":476856,\"title\":\"Tannhäuser\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/er1cMOzosP8EBkRMMLZ6HVcwVS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":7,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A romantic opera in three acts with music and libretto by Richard Wagner, performed by the Orchestra of the Teatro di San Carlo. The original title, Tannhauser und der Sangerkrieg auf Wartburg, reveals the real nature of the opera, born by a fusion of two traditional sagas and dedicated to the dualism of spirituality and sensuality and the possibility of redemption through love. Composed between 1843 and 1845, Tannhauser has a tormented musical theme, made up of constant variations. It debuted in Dresden in 1845 when Wagner was just over 30.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":861038,\"title\":\"Korngold: Die tote Stadt\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/f0AO5vsNyxfUIi55aawElcr1EuW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lhIXhqurZPSr0dNZTLwNDFJEO9M.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Erich Wolfgang Korngold's \\\"Die tote Stadt\\\" in a Bayerische Staatsoper production from 2019, directed by Simon Stone. Kirill Petrenko is conducting Jonas Kaufmann and Marlis Petersen.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1062537,\"title\":\"Tosca\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oEwM8U2KNwAuIXsQGFMYjMcuJy4.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/crq3seLOl3CDV2SQKvGQB6VplI3.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Tosca is a melodrama of love, betrayal and death set in the revolutionary unrest of 1800. The story concerns the opera singer Floria Tosca who tries to save her lover, the painter Mario Cavaradossi, from the brutal chief of police, Scarpia. Through-composed and expertly orchestrated it contains some of Puccini’s best-known lyrical arias and remains one of his most performed operas. In this 2022 production, an eminent cast is directed by the acclaimed Australian director Barrie Kosky – ‘the Amsterdam audience was completely swept off its feet by Kosky’s stunning production’ (Opera News).\",\"genres\":[\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1455664,\"title\":\"Primadonna or Nothing\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ph0MJbmQACNTXbfu9Of8DzKbPYg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ivVau38oovPpZI1VF1RrUM5dAvk.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"From the first steps of an emerging singer to the final bow of a celebrated soprano, 'PRIMADONNA OR NOTHING' follows three relentless women who sacrifice everything to be an opera star.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"-1wNYP_za5c\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"htx3igt0ksk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"gNe0uiQ_U7c\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}